{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14758-burn-notice","id":14758,"title":"Burn Notice","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-20T09:40:27-08:00","id":14758,"title":"Burn Notice","content":"On the one hand, I'm not surprised that <i>Burn Notice</i> isn't given as one of the inspirations for Demon, since it has a light, comedic attitude for the most part. At the same time, it's a great show about spies being left to their own devices and the morally grey places between the law that burned spies live in. As soon as the developers said &quot;techgnostic espionage,&quot; all I could think of was <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5gRdQeuZ9Tw\" target=\"_blank\">this exchange</a>:<br /> <br /> My name is Michael. I used to be an angel until...<br /> [Metatron, on the phone]: We got a burn notice on you. You're cast out.<br /> When you're Fallen, you've got nothing: no cash, no credit, no job history. You're stuck in whatever city you happen to land in.<br /> [Michael]: Where am I?<br /> [Gabriel]: Miami.<br /> You do whatever work comes your way. You rely on anyone who's not working for the God-Machine. A smite-happy ex-girlfriend...<br /> [Gabriel]: Shall we lay waste to them?<br /> An old friend who used to inform on you to the angels.<br /> [Azazel]: You know demons... bunch of bitchy little girls.<br /> Your Cover's family too...<br /> [Azazel]: Hey, is that your mom again?<br /> ...if you're desperate.<br /> [Maddy]: Someone needs your help, Michael!<br /> Bottom line? Until the Judgment Trump blows... you're not going anywhere.<br /> <br /> <br /> When I wind up running Demon, it'll probably be more like supernatural Burn Notice and Leverage than like John Le Carre or Sarah Connor Chronicles. Anyone else wanting to give their Demon game more of a light-hearted bent?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />&quot;The true object of all human life is play. Earth is a task garden; heaven is a playground.&quot; -G.K. Chesterton","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/53-blackwingedheaven","name":"blackwingedheaven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar53_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-20T10:01:35-08:00","id":14772,"title":"","content":"Yeah Burn Notice is what first comes to my mind... but I'm a fan of the show so I'm Biased...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-20T10:42:16-08:00","id":14785,"title":"","content":"The writers talked a lot about it in the development process and iirc it was in an earlier draft of the inspirations page but cut for space. (I've been saying &quot;My name is Michael Weston. I used to be an angel.&quot; at least once a week for longer than I care to admit.)<br /> <br /> I'm aiming for more of a mixed bag? Skating back and forth between light material and the darker stuff. I've been thinking a lot about Buffy the Vampire Slayer, Angel, and Veronica Mars for the tone. But Burn Notice is pretty much my first point of reference for Demon plot ideas.<br /> <br /> Oh - and I've been binging on Chuck for a week. There's a surprising amount of ideas for Demon in there.<br /> <br /> EDIT: And Psych. Eidetic memory and a 'police psychic' cover. Mostly much lighter even than these other inspirations, but the amount of BS they spin in the course of their investigations is relevant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1134-nicias","user":"Nicias","date":". 11-20-2013, 01:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1134-nicias","name":"Nicias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"274"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-20T11:02:12-08:00","id":14793,"title":"","content":"There's also something to be done with Good Omens. Angels and Demons occasionally drinking a beer for a rare truce before going back to their respective jobs, or Angels congratulated for a well-done job... that they took no part into; mortals are to thank/blame for some action that happened to be an occult matrix or a successful Demon hunt. There are few things that annoy Angels more than being forced out of their Cover and having to go look for a new one. And it is indeed a law of the universe that every tape left long enough in a car turns into a Queen tape.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-20T11:43:42-08:00","id":14806,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackwingedheaven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14758-burn-notice#post14758\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When I wind up running Demon, it'll probably be more like supernatural Burn Notice and Leverage than like John Le Carre or Sarah Connor Chronicles. Anyone else wanting to give their Demon game more of a light-hearted bent?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know if you read the playtest blogs and whatnot, but that's basically what I did with my game. Although some of the sillier stuff didn't make it into the playtest report...partially because I wasn't naming celebrities on something that was then going to end up on the internet. (It's a story. If folks catch up with me at a con sometime - given that there are often &quot;Who's going to X con?&quot; threads for meetup purposes - I'll tell it.)<br /> <br /> But yeah, my group are all big fans of the show, so we drew on it heavily for feel. In fact, one of the characters was basically Michael, and then in a mortals game I ran later, a different player decided to play Sam. We tend to mix the serious and horrible with the silly. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-20T14:53:13-08:00","id":14892,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>strider1276</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14758-burn-notice?p=14806#post14806\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't know if you read the playtest blogs and whatnot, but that's basically what I did with my game.</div> </div> </div> </div>I did not, but that's awesome. =3","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />&quot;The true object of all human life is play. Earth is a task garden; heaven is a playground.&quot; -G.K. Chesterton","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/53-blackwingedheaven","name":"blackwingedheaven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar53_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-20T15:40:08-08:00","id":14917,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackwingedheaven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14758-burn-notice?p=14892#post14892\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <di