div> </div>Looks like the White Wolf site is down, and stuff got moved over to the Onyx Path site. New link: <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/another-playtest-why-yes/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/another-playtest-why-yes/</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-16T14:55:46-08:00","id":31231,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>strider1276</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14758-burn-notice?p=30958#post30958\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Looks like the White Wolf site is down, and stuff got moved over to the Onyx Path site. New link: <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/another-playtest-why-yes/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/another-playtest-why-yes/</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Ah! Thanks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T12:38:39-08:00","id":32640,"title":"","content":"Weston is a pretty perfect model for an Integrator.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T16:58:51-08:00","id":32835,"title":"","content":"Fiona seems to me a Saboteur and Sam, a Tempter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/746-kunoichi","name":"Kunoichi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar746_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T17:17:23-08:00","id":32845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neall</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14758-burn-notice?p=32640#post32640\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Weston is a pretty perfect model for an Integrator.</div> </div> </div> </div>Most importantly, a role model for avoiding what seems to be the IC and OOC assumption, that Integrators are chumps.<br /> <br /> (Not that I'm likely to ever play one anyway. Because they're chumps.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T17:37:50-08:00","id":32862,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>squidheadjax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14758-burn-notice?p=32845#post32845\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Most importantly, a role model for avoiding what seems to be the IC and OOC assumption, that Integrators are chumps.<br /> <br /> (Not that I'm likely to ever play one anyway. Because they're chumps.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Why do you say they're chumps? (Just out of curiosity.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T18:12:15-08:00","id":32879,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>strider1276</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14758-burn-notice?p=32862#post32862\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Why do you say they're chumps? (Just out of curiosity.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Partly to be humorous in the context of the rest of the post.<br /> <br /> Beyond this, the pattern I see written into everything GMC-related is that the only thing the God Machine places any actual value on is the homeostasis of the God-Machine, and it's not 100% competent at even that. The best an Integrator not bearing rose-colored optical sensors can hope for upon actually getting back into the system is becoming nothing more than another techno-mystical white blood cell again like the angels that try to kill them actually are, unless its GMC-built hardware glitches and it Falls <i>again</i> to start the whole process over. They're either self-hating or blinded by nostalgia, and even the Integrators' own section of the book kicks them in the head with those terms.<br /> <br /> What really inspires me to place the 'chump' label though, and where Michael Weston the Integrator both shrugs off the label and doesn't quite fit with what I read as the book's description of an Integrator, is the posture of overt <i>supplication</i> to the system that betrayed them every bit as much as they (possibly, perhaps not even in the slightest) betrayed it. It's the &quot;Please, !God, take me back!&quot; as opposed to &quot;I want my job back, and I'm going to make sure it gets done <i>right</i> when I do.&quot; Even though two of the three sub-faction goals have shades of that, they come off as secondary to the &quot;Pleeeeease?&quot; tint.<br /> <br /> And to top it off, the Integrator faction condition beat may as well include a recommended dosage of Motrin for the ST. I don't know how I'd replace it, but if I were to run a Demon game and someone actually wanted to play an Integrator, I'd think about it until I found something else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1096,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","user":"squidheadjax","date":". 12-18-2013, 09:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T18:44:59-08:00","id":32894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>squidheadjax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14758-burn-notice?p=32879#post32879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Partly to be humorous in the context of the rest of the post.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, got ya. That makes sense. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>squidheadjax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14758-burn-notice?p=32879#post32879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Beyond this, the pattern I see written into everything GMC-related is that the only thing the God Machine places any actual value on is the homeostasis of the God-Machine, and it's not 100% competent at even that. The best an Integrator not bearing rose-colored optical sensors can hope for upon actually getting back into the system is becoming nothing more than another techno-mystical white blood cell again like the angels that try to kill them actually are, unless its GMC-built hardware glitches and it Falls <i>again</i> to start the whole process over. They're either self-hating or blinded by nostalgia, and even the Integrators' own section of the book kicks them in the head with those terms.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually - and please keep in mind this is solely an interpretation of mine, not claiming it is &quot;the way&quot; or anything - I see the Integrators as being exceptionally arrogant. They honestly believe that the God-Machine can change - and that they are the ones who can do it. That speaks of a great deal of conceit to me. It's also possible that they are simply deluded and have no idea what they're talking about. Or, it could be a sort of Stockholm Syndrome. Rose-colored nostalgia is not what I immediately think of. (Although yes, that's an option, and is mentioned in the Agenda write-up.)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>squidheadjax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14758-burn-notice?p=32879#post32879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What really inspires me to place the 'chump' label though, and where Michael Weston the Integrator both shrugs off the label and doesn't quite fit with what I read as the book's description of an Integrator, is the posture of overt <i>supplication</i> to the system that betrayed them every bit as much as they (possibly, perhaps not even in the slightest) betrayed it. It's the &quot;Please, !God, take me back!&quot; as opposed to &quot;I want my job back, and I'm going to make sure it gets done <i>right</i> when I do.&quot; Even though two of the three sub-faction goals have shades of that, they come off as secondary to the &quot;Pleeeeease?&quot; tint.</div> </div> </div> </div>See, that second one is closer to how I envision your average Integrator. The former isn't the vibe I've gotten, and wasn't how the Integrator in my game acted, either. (Not saying you're wrong or anything - it just doesn't match my impression or experience.)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>squidheadjax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14758-burn-notice?p=32879#post32879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And to top it off, the Integrator faction condition beat may as well include a recommended dosage of Motrin for the ST. I don't know how I'd replace it, but if I were to run a Demon game and someone actually wanted to play an Integrator, I'd think about it until I found something else.</div> </div> </div> </div>I started writing down an idea myself, but then I got to the point where it was inadvertently detrimental to the entire point of the Agenda. I'll noodle and see what I come up with I suppose. That might be an entirely different discussion or thread, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T18:55:59-08:00","id":32904,"title":"","content":"For what it's worth, of the handful of characters I've spitballed, one and two-halves are Integrators \u2014 one's an antinomian Destroyer whose Cipher angles toward integrating the Fall into the planned workings of the Machine, one's a half-Tempter Guardian with a yen for Norse eschatology, and one's a half-Saboteur Psychopomp working toward the world's most elaborate suicide attempt.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 12-18-2013, 09:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T22:41:20-08:00","id":32979,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.hulu.com/grid/burn-notice?categories=ask%20a%20spy\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.hulu.com/grid/burn-notice?categories=ask%20a%20spy\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.hulu.com/grid/burn-notice?categories=ask%20a%20spy\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.hulu.com/grid/burn-notice?categories=ask%20a%20spy </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T09:19:02-08:00","id":33260,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>strider1276</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14758-burn-notice?p=32894#post32894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Oh, got ya. That makes sense. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Actually - and please keep in mind this is solely an interpretation of mine, not claiming it is &quot;the way&quot; or anything - I see the Integrators as being exceptionally arrogant. They honestly believe that the God-Machine can change - and that they are the ones who can do it. That speaks of a great deal of conceit to me. It's also possible that they are simply deluded and have no idea what they're talking about. Or, it could be a sort of Stockholm Syndrome. Rose-colored nostalgia is not what I immediately think of. (Although yes, that's an option, and is mentioned in the Agenda write-up.) See, that second one is closer to how I envision your average Integrator. The former isn't the vibe I've gotten, and wasn't how the Integrator in my game acted, either. (Not saying you're wrong or anything - it just doesn't match my impression or experience.)</div> </div> </div> </div> Everyone hears different tones at different volumes, I guess, and order of exposure probably influences it too. The first actual setting exposure I had is the opening fiction (which I rarely do more than gloss over, so kudos to whoever wrote it because it grabbed me), which just about painted the Integrators as secondary antagonists and presented them as being percieved in a resoundingly negative light by their fellows. <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>strider1276</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14758-burn-notice?p=32894#post32894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I started writing down an idea myself, but then I got to the point where it was inadvertently detrimental to the entire point of the Agenda. I'll noodle and see what I come up with I suppose. That might be an entirely different discussion or thread, though.</div> </div> </div> </div> Something to represent that they're the only ones who believe the system can be used for something other than its own malignant ends, without being a big red 'player strife' button. The Resolution is right on, at least.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T15:09:58-08:00","id":33442,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>squidheadjax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14758-burn-notice?p=33260#post33260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Everyone hears different tones at different volumes, I guess, and order of exposure probably influences it too. The first actual setting exposure I had is the opening fiction (which I rarely do more than gloss over, so kudos to whoever wrote it because it grabbed me), which just about painted the Integrators as secondary antagonists and presented them as being percieved in a resoundingly negative light by their fellows.</div> </div> </div> </div>I....think I saw it was DaveB, but don't quote me on that. Either way, it's great opening fiction.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}